From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cuttlely vendor <vendor@cuttlely.invalid>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cuttlely: background-mcp-discovery

Serve gateway health while MCP discovery runs across up to four profiles. Gate each API run on its own profile and cancel startup discovery on shutdown. Build /v1/runs agents in a worker under the run profile scope so the discovery wait keeps health and stop requests responsive; recheck shutdown and stop before starting the turn.
